{
  "schema": "rdebug-contract-bindings/1",
  "purpose": "Bind every contract to the controls that enforce it, at symbol level. A contract that is edited without its rules changing the controls is the silent way this project could lose a guarantee: the prose moves, the tests stay green, and nothing reports the gap. Binding by module name alone would not help -- renaming a control would leave the binding intact and just as unverified. So each binding names a symbol that must exist.",
